      "item": [
        {
          "id": "1b4ffa0c-5556-4191-a56b-623824bc57ae",
          "name": "Exchange credentials for delegation tokens.\n\nSupported grant types and authentication:\n- `session_token` (bearer-protected): requires `Authorization: Bearer <Auth0 access token>`. Mints a short-lived (10s) session token bound to the requested integration and project.\n- `delegation_token` (integration-secret protected): exchanges a session token plus the integration `app_secret` for a delegation access token (and, when allowed, a refresh token). No bearer token is used.\n- `refresh_token` (integration-secret protected): exchanges a refresh token plus the integration `app_secret` for a new delegation/refresh pair. No bearer token is used.",
          "request": {
            "name": "Exchange credentials for delegation tokens.\n\nSupported grant types and authentication:\n- `session_token` (bearer-protected): requires `Authorization: Bearer <Auth0 access token>`. Mints a short-lived (10s) session token bound to the requested integration and project.\n- `delegation_token` (integration-secret protected): exchanges a session token plus the integration `app_secret` for a delegation access token (and, when allowed, a refresh token). No bearer token is used.\n- `refresh_token` (integration-secret protected): exchanges a refresh token plus the integration `app_secret` for a new delegation/refresh pair. No bearer token is used.",
            "description": {
              "content": "Exchange credentials for delegation tokens.\n\nSupported grant types and authentication:\n- `session_token` (bearer-protected): requires `Authorization: Bearer <Auth0 access token>`. Mints a short-lived (10s) session token bound to the requested integration and project.\n- `delegation_token` (integration-secret protected): exchanges a session token plus the integration `app_secret` for a delegation access token (and, when allowed, a refresh token). No bearer token is used.\n- `refresh_token` (integration-secret protected): exchanges a refresh token plus the integration `app_secret` for a new delegation/refresh pair. No bearer token is used.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
